# Task 2 – Dashboard Development

## Project Overview
This task focuses on creating an **Interactive Power BI Dashboard** that visualizes key business metrics and KPIs to enable data-driven decision making.

## Objectives
- Design and develop an interactive Power BI dashboard
- Track and visualize critical business KPIs
- Create insightful data visualizations for stakeholder reporting
- Enable real-time monitoring of business performance

## Key Components

### 1. Business KPIs
- Revenue Metrics
- Sales Performance
- Customer Metrics
- Operational Efficiency Indicators
- Growth Trends

### 2. Data Visualization
- Interactive charts and graphs
- Drill-down capabilities
- Filter and slicer functionality
- Real-time data refresh
- Mobile-responsive design

### 3. Dashboard Features
- Executive summary view
- Detailed performance analytics
- Comparative analysis across periods
- Trend analysis and forecasting
- Custom KPI indicators

## Technical Stack
- **Power BI Desktop** – Dashboard development
- **Data Sources** – SQL databases, Excel files, APIs
- **DAX** – Data Analysis Expressions for calculations
- **M Language** – Data transformation and cleaning

## Deliverables
- Interactive Power BI dashboard file (.pbix)
- Dashboard documentation and user guide
- KPI definitions and calculations
- Data refresh schedule documentation

## Project Outcomes
- Improved visibility into business performance
- Faster decision-making through real-time insights
- Enhanced stakeholder reporting
- Automated KPI tracking and monitoring

